raining data.', 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework.'], 'type': ['method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 4]}, 'Data Augmentation Techniques': {'description': ['The specific methods used for data augmentation, which are missing from the original extraction.', 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework.'], 'type': ['method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 4]}, 'GLUE tasks': {'description': ['Tasks used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT.', 'A set of natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of language models.', 'A benchmark for evaluating natural language understanding systems.'], 'type': ['task', 'dataset'], 'source_chunk_index': [9, 10, 5]}, 'Knowledge Distillation': {'description': ['A method used to train smaller models (like TinyBERT) to mimic the behavior of larger models (like BERT).', 'The specific type of distillation method used in the study, where knowledge is transferred from a larger model (BERT) to a smaller one (TinyBERT).', 'The method used to train the student models, referred to as "KD method" in the text.', 'A technique used in TinyBERT to transfer knowledge from a larger model to a smaller one.', 'A technique used to transfer knowledge from a larger model to a smaller one.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [5, 8, 10, 12, 15]}, 'Multi-Head Attention (MHA)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within the Transformer architecture that allows the model to attend to different parts of the input sequence.', 'A layer within the Transformer architecture.'], 'type': ['method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [5, 6]}, 'Feed-Forward Network (FFN)': {'description': ['A sub-layer within the Transformer architecture.', 'A fully connected network within the Transformer architecture.'], 'type': ['method', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [5, 6]}, 'Embedding-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique applied to the embedding layer of the Transformer model.', 'A 