answering tasks. ; A student model designed to learn from the teacher BERT model.\n', 'Name:TWO-STAGE LEARNING FRAMEWORK\nDescription:A framework for TinyBERT that performs Transformer distillation at both the pretraining and task-specific learning stages. ; A framework that involves both pre-training and fine-tuning stages to capture general and task-specific knowledge. ; A learning approach used in the context of TinyBERT.\n', 'Name:GLUE BENCHMARK\nDescription:A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of language models on various natural language processing tasks. ; A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models, including BERT, XLNet, RoBERTa, and SpanBERT.\n', 'Name:NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING (NLP)\nDescription:The field of computer science concerned with giving computers the ability to understand text and spoken words in much the same way human beings can.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=161, avg_entity_tokens=39, max_entities=140, num_groups=2, entities_per_group=[140, 21]
